        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Grohl, Mark Monroe, King Buzzo, Osborne\n- Bands: Foo Fighters, Nirvana\n- Works: Sonic Highways, King Buzzo\n- Topics: documentary miniseries, music history, American cities\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Sonic Highways was released as an American documentary miniseries directed by Dave Grohl and written by Mark Monroe.\n- Sonic Highways consists of eight episodes, and each episode explores the musical history of a different American city through interviews conducted by Dave Grohl.\n- Dave Grohl was the drummer of Nirvana before becoming the founder, frontman, lead vocalist, guitarist, and primary songwriter of Foo Fighters.\n- Osborne recruited Nirvana drummer Dave Grohl for the King Buzzo project.",
